-  The [*Perspektywy*](http://perspektywy.pl) Education Foundation has prepared its university ranking for the 17th time, assessing public and private universities and higher vocational schools. The ranking is intended mainly for secondary school students choosing their studies. The **mathematics** programme run by the Faculty of Mathematics and Computer Science of the University of Wrocław achieved a high fourth place, moving up two positions.
+  The [*Perspektywy*](http://perspektywy.pl) (Perspectives) Education Foundation has prepared its university ranking for the 17th time, assessing public and private universities and higher vocational schools. The ranking is intended mainly for secondary school students choosing their studies. The **mathematics** programme run by the Faculty of Mathematics and Computer Science of the University of Wrocław achieved a high fourth place, moving up two positions.
 
